					"id": 4660718,
					"content": "哦，老爷他…啊，不不，迪卢克先生他一直在柜台，哪儿也没去过。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						4660719
					],
					"speakerTitle": "杰克"
				},
				{
					"id": 4660719,
					"content": "这样啊…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						4660720
					],
					"speakerTitle": "霍夫曼"
				},
				{
					"id": 4660720,
					"content": "霍夫曼先生，这是你之前点的蒲公英酒。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						4660721
					],
					"speakerTitle": "迪卢克"
				},
				{
					"id": 4660721,
					"content": "喝了它早点回去吧，代我向骑士团的各位问好。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						4660722
					],
					"speakerTitle": "迪卢克"
				},
				{
					"id": 4660722,
					"content": "啊…不用了，我现在着急回骑士团复命，这杯就敬给您吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						4660723
					],
					"speakerTitle": "霍夫曼"
				},
				{
					"id": 4660723,
					"content": "…呼…真是奇怪。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						4660724
					],
					"speakerTitle": "霍夫曼"
				},
				{
					"id": 4660724,
					"content": "呼哇…刚才真是吓死了，我还以为肯定露馅了…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						4660725
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 4660725,
					"content": "这点我早有预想，所以…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						4660726
					],
					"speakerTitle": "迪卢克"
				},
				{
					"id": 4660726,
					"content": "…今天除了你们之外，所有客人都是晨曦酒庄过来的自己人。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						4660727
					],
					"speakerTitle": "迪卢克"
				},
				{
					"id": 4660727,
					"content": "全都是托吗！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						4660728
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 4660728,
					"content": "不是所有哦…严格来说，是「除我以外」。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						4660729
					],
					"speakerTitle": "凯亚"
				},
				{
					"id": 4660729,
					"content": "是凯亚！你怎么在这儿？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						4660730
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 4660730,
					"content": "只是挑了个可以安安静静看戏的好位置而已。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						4660731
					],
					"speakerTitle": "凯亚"
				},
				{
					"id": 4660731,
					"content": "难道…从一开始你就在了吗？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						4660732
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 4660732,
					"content": "没错，这部「暗夜英雄的不在场证明」真是精彩，比美酒还要醉人。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						4660733
					],
					"speakerTitle": "凯亚"
				},
				{
					"id": 4660733,
					"content": "哼…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						4660734
					],
					"speakerTitle": "迪卢克"
				},
				{
					"id": 4660734,
					"content": "然后呢？你准备把这些都报告给骑士团？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						4660735
					],
					"speakerTitle": "迪卢克"
				},
				{
					"id": 4660735,
					"content": "哈哈哈…你应该了解我的，我对告密的事儿可没什么兴趣。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						4660736
					],
					"speakerTitle": "凯亚"
				},
				{
					"id": 4660736,
					"content": "只是单纯想要知道，蒙德的「暗夜英雄」可以做到什么程度…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						4660737
					],
					"speakerTitle": "凯亚"
				},
				{
					"id": 4660737,
					"content": "果然，永远不会让人失望。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						4660738
					],
					"speakerTitle": "凯亚"
				},
				{
					"id": 4660738,
					"content": "我还不需要向你证明什么。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						4660739
					],
					"speakerTitle": "迪卢克"
				},
				{
					"id": 4660739,
					"content": "那是自然。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						4660740
					],
					"speakerTitle": "凯亚"
				},
				{
					"id": 4660740,
					"content": "但最让我意外的是，孤高的「暗夜英雄」居然也会接受别人的帮助…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						4660741
					],
					"speakerTitle": "凯亚"
				},
				{
					"id": 4660741,
					"content": "抱歉本店已经打烊了，客人你请回吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						4660742
					],
					"speakerTitle": "迪卢克"
				},
				{
					"id": 4660742,
					"content": "好了好了，今晚我已经不需要酒来助兴了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						4660743
					],
					"speakerTitle": "凯亚"
				},
				{
					"id": 4660743,
					"content": "不过在离开前，我还有句话想说。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						4660744
					],
					"speakerTitle": "凯亚"
				},
				{
					"id": 4660744,
					"content": "那就最后一句。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						4660745
					],
					"speakerTitle": "迪卢克"
				},
				{
					"id": 4660745,
					"content": "迪卢克，你有了这个「助手」，我可是感到了一种奇妙的安心啊。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						4660746
					],
					"speakerTitle": "凯亚"
				},
				{
					"id": 4660746,
					"content": "……",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						4660747
					],
					"speakerTitle": "迪卢克"
				},
				{
					"id": 4660747,
					"content": "祝愿你们有一个美妙的夜晚，回见。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						4660748
					],
					"speakerTitle": "凯亚"
				},
				{
					"id": 4660748,
					"content": "凯亚的意思是…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						4660749
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 4660749,
					"content": "别管那家伙了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						4660750
					],
					"speakerTitle": "迪卢克"
				},
				{
					"id": 4660750,
					"content": "你们这次帮了我这么多，这是谢礼。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						4660751
					],
					"speakerTitle": "迪卢克"
				},
				{
					"id": 4660751,
					"content": "唔哇！谢谢迪卢克老爷！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						4660752
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 4660752,
					"content": "虽说已经习惯一个人行动，但有你们帮忙的感觉也还不错。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						4660753
					],
					"speakerTitle": "迪卢克"
				},
				{
					"id": 4660753,
					"content": "今后有什么需要，可以来找我。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "迪卢克"
				},
				{
					"id": 4660710,
					"content": "放心，我只是在门口运动了下。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						4660711
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 4660711,
					"content": "是吗，可是为什么偏偏选了这个时候…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						4660712
					],
					"speakerTitle": "霍夫曼"
				}
			]
		},
